mall/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_k.jpg","foto_abstract":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_RF_Leis_140px.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/ML_233_Leis.svg","x_coordinate":732872.1278835955,"y_coordinate":164396.57392958304,"description":"From the starting point of Vals Post Office through the village of Vals to the valley station of the Vals cable car. From there take the gondola to the mountain station in the direction of «Gadastatt». The descent starts at the summit station of the Vals cable car. A steep descent with up to 25% gradient on the first section to «Büdemlihus» hut. On firm surfaces to »Upper Büni» with the beautiful «Gannitobel» waterfall. The trail continues to «Güngelbord», and on to Leis (a fine opportunity to rest and eat at Restaurant Ganni), then further on to «Zorts», «Soladüra», «Wolfazu» and «Camp». The tour winds down pleasantly to its end on the way back through the valley bottom to Vals Post Office/ valley station.\n\nVarious sites such as the «Büdemlihus» hut, the «Gannitobel» with its impressive waterfall, and the chapels and churches make this route a real pleasure.","length":10,"length_asphalt":6,"length_unsurfaced":4,"length_singletrail":0,"height_difference":80,"height_difference_back":620,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":null,"hiking_time_back":null,"category_grade":"easy","category_grade_text":null,"category_grade_skiing":null,"category_condition":"easy","category_condition_text":null,"cantons":[2],"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_2.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_3.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_6.jpg"],"photo_gallery_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_233_Trail_3_Leis_4_g.jpg","","",""],"photo_gallery_urls":[null,null,null,null],"photo_gallery_ids":["215974","20681","20682","20684"],"photo_gallery_copy